			"notes": "### 0.2.7-beta\n\n**Additions**\n- Added quick text formatting to Signboard UI actions for bold, italic, underline, colors... and generally improved the UI\n- Added Signboard text centering\n- Added Signboard arrow-key movement for precise signboard element positioning.\n- Added Create Clipboard support for copying and pasting complete signboard configurations.\n\n**Changes**\n- Updated NeoForge to 21.1.247 and Create to 6.0.10-247.\n- Changed signboard's element's point precision bigger (int -> float 0.25)\n- Improved block collision handling for truss-like structures.\n- Made signboards have proper Hitbox and also they break when their supporting block gets removed\n\n**Fixes**\n- Fixed a bug that blocks were slowly mined and enchantments were ignored by adding a proper DataGen capabilities.\n- Fixed elements that were rendering even outside bounds for Signboard BE\n- Fixed a bug for Advanced Traffic Light that did not allow individual lights to be removed by a wrench (PR)\n- Fixed unsupported signboard positions being accepted by the parser.\n- Removed JEI rendering overlay rendering in GUIs while being hidden\n- Improved block registration and datagen handling.\n\nAs always, please back-up your worlds as a precaution."
		},
